      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她已经完全能和景致分庭抗礼了……\n多亏了她，今年的三后冠赛线\n真让人移不开眼啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c1a09fe1039133ff45c55954a4b35c2f184a9660225465de3ad08a1db38665d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
