      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是啊。毕竟她们总是能带来让人心跳加速、\n战至最后一刻的比赛。\n今天到底谁会赢呢……真让人期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c20375e05e17ba9f4724c843bbcd0f26523a2472a31e8561768167147c5f4a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
